ORDERS OF THE DAY
for the meeting of the National Assembly to be held on Tuesday, the 11th November' 2025at 11.00 a.m.1. Tilawot, Hodith, Noot and national anthem'
CALLIN
G ATTEN
TION NOTICE
2. DR. SHARMILA FARUQUI MR. RAMESH LALMR. KHURSHID AHMED JUNEJO to invite attention of the Minister for lnterior' to amatter of urgent public importance regarding 35% surge in cybercrimes in 2025, challenging publiCsafety and existing cyber security measures, causing grave concern amongst the public'
LEGISLAT
IVE BUSINESS
3. SENATOR AZAM NAZEER TARAR, Minister for Law and Justice, to move that the Bill further toamend the Constitution of the lslamic Republic of Pakistan [The Constitution (Twenty-seventhAmendment)Bill,2025l,aspassedbytheSenate,betakenintoconsiderationatonce'4. SENATOR AZAM NAZEER TARAR, Minister for Law and Justice, to move that the Bill further toamend the constitution of the lslamic Republic of Pakistan [The constitution (Twenty-seventhAmendment) Bill, 20251, be Passed.5. MR. KHALID MAqBoot slDDlqul, Minister for Federal Education and Professional TraininS'to move that the Bill to establish the King Hamad university of Nursing and Associated Medicalsciences [The King Hamad University of Nursing and Associated Medical sciences Bill, 2025], aspassed by the Senate, be taken into consideration at once'6. MR. KHALID MAQBOOL SlDDlQUl, Minister for Federal Education and Professional Training'to move that the Bill to establish the KinS Hamad University of Nursing and Associated Medicalsciences [The King Hamad University of Nursing and Associated Medical sciences Bill,2025], bepassed.7. MR. KHALID MAQBOOT slDDlQUl, Minister for Federal Education and Professional Training'to move that the Bill to provide for the establishment and manaSement of the Daanish schools [TheDaanish schools Authority }il,2025), as passed by the senate, be taken into consideration at once'g. MR. KHALID MAqBOOL S|DD|QUl, Minister for Federal Education and Professional Training'to provide for the establishment and management of the Daanish schools [The Daanish schoolsAuthority Bill, 20251, be Passed.
MOTI
N OF THANKS
